msgid "pdo_To_enable_aging_set_Activate"
msgstr "(en) To enable aging set Activate password aging to yes. Then select each user you want aging enabled for setting Activate password aging to No disables aging check for all users. But keep your user settings in case you activate the aging back This can be done for locked or passwordless accounts too. <br><strong>Note</strong>: password aging does not apply to the admin account."

